## Third-party components

### Galmuri11

The pixel typeface bundled with the popup (`ai_agents_usage_monitor/popup/Galmuri11.woff2`)
is Galmuri11 by Minseo Lee, Copyright (c) 2019-2023, licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full licence text ships alongside the
font as `Galmuri11-OFL.txt` and is available at https://openfontlicense.org.

The font is redistributed unmodified. The MIT terms above cover this
application's own source; they do not apply to the font.
